46
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:04,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-Three years?!</font>

47
00:02:16,590 --> 00:02:21,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It took Old-timer
Turtle Hermit three years?!</font>

48
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:25,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right. How long
will it take you, I wonder?</font>

49
00:02:28,270 --> 00:02:33,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get serious! I can't wait that long!</font>

50
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:37,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you can't wait, then you'll need
to hurry and steal this jar from me.</font>

51
00:02:37,690 --> 00:02:43,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, I guess maybe I'll take
a catnap for three days or so...</font>

52
00:02:50,370 --> 00:02:53,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! It's mine!</font>

53
00:03:07,890 --> 00:03:11,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, the <i>Zanzouken</i>...
["Afterimage Technique"]</font>

54
00:03:18,230 --> 00:03:19,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There!</font>

55
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:23,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Too bad! I was over here!</font>

56
00:03:25,570 --> 00:03:27,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow!</font>

57
00:03:31,050 --> 00:03:33,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well? What did you think of
my <i>Zanzouken</i> retaliation?</font>

58
00:03:33,550 --> 00:03:37,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, good night.</font>

59
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:38,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Darn it!</font>

60
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:43,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why am I this out of breath?!</font>

61
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:56,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I'll try again with everything I've got!</i></font>

62
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:06,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh yeah, I haven't eaten
anything since yesterday...</font>

63
00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:13,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come to think of it, I haven't eaten
anything for five years myself...</font>

64
00:04:13,890 --> 00:04:18,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, yes. I'll have something
to eat before my nap!</font>

65
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:36,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, time to eat! Food!</font>

66
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:37,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Food...</font>

67
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:39,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Food?!</font>

68
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:44,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I humbly accept this meal.</font>

69
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:49,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Food!</font>

70
00:04:49,430 --> 00:04:51,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is for you.</font>

71
00:04:54,930 --> 00:04:56,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is all?!</font>

72
00:04:56,630 --> 00:05:00,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's not fair! Keeping
all the food for yourself!</font>

73
00:05:00,970 --> 00:05:02,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You ate it all!</font>

74
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:07,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll pay dearly if you
keep complaining about it!</font>

75
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's a hermit bean.</font>

76
00:05:09,180 --> 00:05:13,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They're called <i>Senzu</i>, and just
one will keep you full for 10 days.</font>

77
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wonderful beans, they are.</font>

78
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:19,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I need lots of food!</font>

79
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:22,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just one of these beans isn't enough...</font>

80
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"Fsshhh"</font>

81
00:05:32,530 --> 00:05:37,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yes. You mentioned earlier
about being out of breath.</font>

82
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:40,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That would be because
the air up here is thin.</font>

83
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:43,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We <i>are</i> at quite a high elevation, after all.</font>

84
00:05:45,550 --> 00:05:50,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You make a lot of wasted movements
so you quickly run out of breath.</font>

85
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:55,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? What could this be? Trash, perhaps?</font>

86
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:59,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll throw it out, then.</font>

87
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:02,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My Four-Star Ball! When did it?!</font>

88
00:06:04,900 --> 00:06:06,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What're you doing?!</font>

89
00:06:12,570 --> 00:06:16,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If the Red Ribbon Army gets that ball, I'd!</font>

90
00:06:16,450 --> 00:06:17,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Upa!</font>

91
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:35,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's see...</font>

92
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:39,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not here...</font>

93
00:06:43,590 --> 00:06:45,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Found it!</font>

94
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:49,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Darn that stupid cat!</font>

95
00:06:49,430 --> 00:06:51,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm gonna beat his brains out!</font>

96
00:07:17,420 --> 00:07:23,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Back in only three hours?</i>
<i>His first time took a full day.</i></font>

97
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! I'll tell you this right now!</font>

98
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:35,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is called the Four-Star Ball
and it's really important...</font>

99
00:07:35,950 --> 00:07:38,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Are you listening to me?!</font>

100
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:42,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't even tell if you're
awake or asleep! Hey!</font>

101
00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:44,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wake up!</font>

102
00:08:32,980 --> 00:08:36,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>No. I won't try any unfair tricks.</i></font>

103
00:08:36,650 --> 00:08:38,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I will get it, though!</i></font>

104
00:08:49,490 --> 00:08:55,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He's more honest than I thought.</i>
<i>Completely different than Muten Roshi.</i></font>

105
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:59,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>His Zanzouken was absolutely</i>
<i>spectacular as well...</i></font>

106
00:08:59,340 --> 00:09:01,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I look forward to seeing</i>
<i>how well he improves...</i></font>

107
00:09:48,930 --> 00:09:52,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's the matter?
Out of breath already?!</font>

108
00:09:52,300 --> 00:10:00,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The sun eventually set on</i>
<i>Goku's second day on Karin Tower...</i></font>

109
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come and get it!</font>

110
00:10:11,450 --> 00:10:12,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's no use...</font>

111
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:15,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your breathing has
improved quite a bit.</font>

112
00:10:15,390 --> 00:10:17,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah... But I'm...</font>

113
00:10:17,590 --> 00:10:21,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's call it a day and get some rest.</font>

114
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:23,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He's progressing at an astonishing speed!</i></font>

115
00:10:23,930 --> 00:10:27,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>This boy is completely</i>
<i>unpredictable, even for me!</i></font>

116
00:11:09,830 --> 00:11:13,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! I <i>will</i> get it today!</font>

117
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go ahead and try!</font>

118
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:27,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fool! You're thinking too hard!</font>

119
00:11:34,590 --> 00:11:35,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>My right!</i></font>

120
00:11:35,690 --> 00:11:37,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's fast!</font>

121
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:48,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, no!</font>

122
00:11:50,770 --> 00:11:53,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't! You'll fall!</font>

123
00:11:54,180 --> 00:11:55,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Boy!</font>

124
00:11:57,850 --> 00:11:59,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fooled you!</font>

125
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:05,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did it! I got the jar!</font>

126
00:12:05,190 --> 00:12:09,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>What an astounding lad!</i>
<i>It took him only three days!</i></font>

127
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can drink it, right?</font>

128
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:13,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of course. Drink up.</font>

129
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:36,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't really feel any different...</font>

130
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:38,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of course not.</font>

131
00:12:38,950 --> 00:12:42,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Super Spirit Water is
ordinary, everyday water.</font>

132
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:46,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?! That's mean!
You tricked me, didn't you?!</font>

133
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:50,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I haven't tricked you.</font>

134
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:54,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your strength has already
increased several-fold.</font>

135
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:58,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now do you finally realize?</font>

136
00:12:58,710 --> 00:13:04,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Going up and down Karin Tower,
trying to steal the jar from me...</font>

137
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:08,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It was all training meant
to multiply your strength!</font>

138
00:13:08,550 --> 00:13:10,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh!</font>

139
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:20,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Excellent. You made it
exactly to my specifications.</font>

140
00:13:20,690 --> 00:13:22,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I spent so much time on it,
I haven't slept for days.</font>

141
00:13:22,660 --> 00:13:27,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then, time to go get
this so-called Dragon Ball...</font>

142
00:13:27,330 --> 00:13:31,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">U-Um... What about the money?</font>

143
00:13:31,340 --> 00:13:35,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What? Are you saying you wish
to take money from Tao Pai Pai,</font>

144
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:38,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">the world's greatest and
most famous assassin?</font>

145
00:13:38,710 --> 00:13:42,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-I have to make a living!</font>

146
00:13:42,180 --> 00:13:44,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Very well. I'll tell you what.</font>

147
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:49,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm an assassin. Instead of money,
I will murder someone for you.</font>

148
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're very lucky!</font>

149
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:54,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My assassination fee is so high you
could spend your entire life working</font>

150
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:58,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and still never be able to pay it.</font>

151
00:13:58,230 --> 00:14:01,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So tell me, who do you want dead?</font>

152
00:14:01,540 --> 00:14:06,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">N-No! There isn't anyone I want killed!</font>

153
00:14:06,310 --> 00:14:09,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then <i>you</i> get to die.</font>

154
00:14:14,210 --> 00:14:16,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Keep the change.</font>

155
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:31,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then! Return to the world below
and test out your newfound skills!</font>

156
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:33,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks, Karin-<i>sama</i>!</font>

157
00:14:33,970 --> 00:14:36,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You certainly are an amicable fellow!</font>

158
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:39,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bye bye! I'll see you later!</font>

159
00:14:39,910 --> 00:14:42,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yahoo!</font>

160
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:50,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He may have already</i>
<i>surpassed Muten Roshi!</i></font>

161
00:15:08,830 --> 00:15:11,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's been three days...</font>

162
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:15,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wonder if Goku-<i>san</i> made it to the top...</font>

163
00:15:35,790 --> 00:15:38,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So my father's murderer is back?!</font>

164
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:44,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There was one more
Dragon Ball here. Give it to me.</font>

165
00:15:59,170 --> 00:16:01,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It would seem you didn't hear me.</font>

166
00:16:01,910 --> 00:16:05,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Speak up! Where is the Dragon Ball?!</font>

167
00:16:06,310 --> 00:16:09,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-I'd never tell you!</font>

168
00:16:09,550 --> 00:16:12,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you don't tell me, I'll kill you right here!</font>

169
00:16:12,090 --> 00:16:16,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can always use a special radar to
