171
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:24,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">F-Father!</font>

172
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're a stubborn little runt!</font>

173
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:29,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In that case, I shall kill you
