174
00:16:33,930 --> 00:16:35,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

175
00:16:44,940 --> 00:16:47,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I made it in time!</font>

176
00:16:47,750 --> 00:16:50,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What?!</font>

177
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:52,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G-Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

178
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:55,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thought I told you to hide!</font>

179
00:16:55,990 --> 00:16:58,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you really <i>did</i> survive, boy!</font>

180
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:06,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did you make it to the top?!
