181
00:17:06,930 --> 00:17:10,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yep! I feel great!</font>

182
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:11,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yay!</font>

183
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:24,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stay here on the cloud!</font>

184
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:25,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right!</font>

185
00:17:35,730 --> 00:17:38,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I</i> have the Dragon Ball!</font>

186
00:17:38,670 --> 00:17:41,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you climbed up the tower to hide...</font>

187
00:17:41,630 --> 00:17:48,810
