196
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:23,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll never let you have it!</font>

197
00:18:23,940 --> 00:18:27,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You won't beat me up again!</font>

198
00:18:27,710 --> 00:18:30,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You sad, ignorant fool.</font>

199
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:33,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I shall put an end to your
