210
00:19:34,110 --> 00:19:37,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right! You're pretty smart!</font>

211
00:19:37,650 --> 00:19:41,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I see! So that's why he's this strong now...</i></font>

212
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:44,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I figured it was just an old myth,</i></font>

213
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:47,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>but to think that it was actually true...</i></font>

214
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Things have become interesting!</font>

215
00:19:51,130 --> 00:19:56,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe I'll do some light
