222
00:20:13,790 --> 00:20:15,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go ahead!</font>

223
00:20:15,620 --> 00:20:18,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get him, Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

224
