261
00:26:09,150 --> 00:26:11,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right! Get him, Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

262
00:26:11,820 --> 00:26:15,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How dare you mock me!
