263
00:26:54,660 --> 00:26:56,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's wrong, Goku-<i>san</i>?!</font>

264
00:26:56,360 --> 00:26:59,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How come you're getting beat up
