265
00:27:15,320 --> 00:27:16,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">End of the line!</font>

266
00:27:19,860 --> 00:27:22,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G-Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

267
00:27:57,540 --> 00:27:59,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's finally dead!</font>

268
00:27:59,470 --> 00:28:01,970
