274
00:28:25,980 --> 00:28:27,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Insolent little brat!</font>

275
00:28:51,670 --> 00:28:53,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

