277
00:29:07,920 --> 00:29:09,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Unbelievable!</i></font>

278
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:11,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>This cannot be happening!</i></font>

279
00:29:14,630 --> 00:29:16,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here I come again!</font>

280
00:29:23,270 --> 00:29:25,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I- I'm going to lose at this rate!</i></font>

281
00:29:25,440 --> 00:29:26,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-I'm sorry!</font>

282
00:29:28,910 --> 00:29:32,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sorry! Forgive me!</font>

283
00:29:32,110 --> 00:29:35,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please! I beg of you!</font>

284
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:37,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll never do anything bad ever again!</font>

285
00:29:46,090 --> 00:29:50,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I beg you! Forgive me! Please?</font>

286
00:29:50,330 --> 00:29:54,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't know what to think...
