303
00:31:33,960 --> 00:31:35,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

304
00:31:44,300 --> 00:31:46,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! You wait here, Upa!</font>

305
00:31:46,910 --> 00:31:52,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I promise I'll collect all the Dragon
