306
00:31:52,350 --> 00:31:53,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

307
00:31:53,150 --> 00:31:55,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>! Be careful!</font>

308
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

309
00:32:03,760 --> 00:32:05,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>What is the fate of Goku,</i></font>

